      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "熙初封汝陽公，討劉喬有功，進爵為王。永嘉末，沒于石勒。",
